intervention_descriptions:
Induction Therapy: Becotatug Vedotin (MRG003) 2.0 mg/kg, intravenous infusion, Day 1 (3 cycles, Q3W) | Induction Therapy: Pucotenlimab 200 mg, intravenous infusion, Day 1 (3 cycles, Q3W);

Adjuvant Therapy: Pucotenlimab 200 mg, intravenous infusion, Day 1 (6 cycles, Q3W) | Induction Therapy (3 cycles, Q3W):

Gemcitabine 1000 mg/m², intravenous infusion, Days 1 and 8 Cisplatin 80 mg/m², intravenous infusion, Day 1 | 70 Gy in 33 fractions, once daily, 5 days per week | Concurrent Cisplatin: 100 mg/m², intravenous infusion, Day 1 (2 cycles, Q3W) during radiation
